    <div class="content-split__content" style="background: var(--color-dark-pine);">
      <span class="content-split__eyebrow">Who Can Apply</span>
      <h2 class="content-split__heading">Eligibility Requirements</h2>
      <p class="content-split__text">The Competitive Grants program is open to nonprofit organizations serving the Teton Valley community. Applicants must meet the following criteria:</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Must be a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization</li>
        <li>Must serve Teton Valley residents and communities</li>
        <li>Must demonstrate community need and organizational capacity</li>
        <li>Previous grant recipients must have submitted required reports</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

